 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Monetize cautiously or preserve disaggregated evidence\nDocument valuation sources, uncertainty, non-monetized effects, and double-counting checks."]
 S5 --> S6
 S7["7. Test uncertainty, rebound, and robust decisions\nCompare options under plausible use, life, price, environmental, recovery, and induced-demand scenarios."]
 S6 --> S7
 S8["8. Issue a transparent decision with safeguards\nPresent conventional and circularity-adjusted results, mandatory constraints, conditions, and review triggers."]
